1
00:00:02,375 --> 00:00:04,625
Thank you, Lord
Severin, for accepting me.

2
00:00:04,625 --> 00:00:05,625
From this moment on,

3
00:00:05,625 --> 00:00:07,208
you are the new
head of the Morellan family.

4
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:10,708
Come on.

5
00:00:10,708 --> 00:00:13,125
Let me escort my
bride to her throne.

6
00:00:13,416 --> 00:00:14,625
Yes, my lord.

7
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:21,125
Listen, everyone.

8
00:00:21,458 --> 00:00:23,708
Elowen Morellan, heir
of the Morellan family,

9
00:00:23,708 --> 00:00:25,958
is the true
bride of this wedding.

10
00:00:26,125 --> 00:00:28,125
She is my wife.

11
00:00:31,583 --> 00:00:32,791
- Severin!
- Severin!

12
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:34,291
Hell yeah!

13
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:39,875
If you want to
be a kept man,

14
00:00:39,875 --> 00:00:41,916
get the hell out
of the Holy Cathedral!

15
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:44,291
This is my wedding with Redmond.

16
00:00:45,083 --> 00:00:48,208
Your wedding with Redmond?

17
00:00:48,791 --> 00:00:50,125
Of course it is.

18
00:00:50,125 --> 00:00:52,791
Did you forget I
publicly ended our engagement?

19
00:00:53,208 --> 00:00:54,541
Redmond is my groom now.

20
00:00:54,541 --> 00:00:58,875
Livia, you’ve even forgotten
who reserved this cathedral.

21
00:00:58,875 --> 00:01:00,250
So what if you booked it?

22
00:01:00,250 --> 00:01:02,291
The Scott family can
pay ten times the deposit.

23
00:01:02,291 --> 00:01:04,291
Today I will marry Redmond here.

24
00:01:04,291 --> 00:01:06,041
Take your woman and
get out of my cathedral!

25
00:01:06,041 --> 00:01:07,500
to speak to my husband's family and wipe

26
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:08,916
that disgusting look off your face

27
00:01:08,916 --> 00:01:10,583
You dared hit me?

28
00:01:11,125 --> 00:01:12,708
Say one more word
and I can erase

29
00:01:12,708 --> 00:01:14,875
your entire house
with a single command.
